 rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2094</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/16e28a5c41d775a9fbaae8dbc80f0c3ef89a2d65\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">16e28a5</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Bring back support seo_url function in Sitemap.php (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2093\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2093</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/af9bf7382ca1318eef3f349efeddbd1ea32b28b1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">af9bf73</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Add system information dashboard to admin panel (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2092\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2092</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/9a4d30c6daadf3d413239b1cf0c06373e174b672\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">9a4d30c</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Enhance client IP detection with trusted proxy validation (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2085\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2085</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/1e3e58aeed66d73292c529eb2c3110408ae83e71\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">1e3e58a</a>)</li>\n</ul><h3 class=\"bbHeading\"><a class=\"u-anchorTarget\" name=\"-gear-miscellaneous\"></a>⚙️ Miscellaneous&#8203;<a class=\"hoverLink\" href=\"#-gear-miscellaneous\" title=\"Permanent link\"></a></h3><ul>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(ci)</i> Removed docker-publish.yml (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2107\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2107</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/67af55216999020bda7186e22301a626c95d3667\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">67af552</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(docker)</i> Configure MySQL charset and collation (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2102\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2102</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/9b00d571b14acb1c93515f98f9233b340dc9a7ea\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">9b00d57</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Some minor improvements &amp; updated Docker setup instructions (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2101\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2101</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/01b5269f22eb3d926a5453767bc295364ad8210c\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">01b5269</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Docker support (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2100\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2100</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/e7b178146eea02b77c4d89cdfa02a4dfe34ade57\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">e7b1781</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added missing mysqli extension in README &amp; updated some workflows (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2091\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2091</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/7c3faa922f610810d06c05c7044e07ac18952593\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">7c3faa9</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Fixed incorrect installation guidlines in README.md (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2090\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2090</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/2468b60363e303747c614bb4854f022c2abd32c2\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">2468b60</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Use text captcha driver by default (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2084\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2084</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/7a393e3548cf9866e322794b88e105da780ecbfe\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">7a393e3</a>)</li>\n</ul><h2 class=\"bbHeading\"><a class=\"u-anchorTarget\" name=\"-new-contributors-red-heart\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 18px\">New Contributors</span> ❤️&#8203;<a class=\"hoverLink\" href=\"#-new-contributors-red-heart\" title=\"Permanent link\"></a></h2><ul>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><a href=\"https://github.com/advancedalloy\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">@advancedalloy</a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/2100\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#2100</a></li>\n</ul>",
